  <LocalizedText>
    <Text id="OftenOviour_MOD_UGEFD_NAME">
		<en_US>(Pro Version)Raise troops for a thousand day, and use then for a while</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>养兵千日，用兵一时（优化版）</zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
	<Text id="OftenOviour_MOD_UGEFD_DESC">
		<en_US>The Pro Version of the Mod with the same name. Districts would only provide Exp for MATCHED Units (eg. Harbor provides Exp for Navals); District itself provide +2 Exp (Aerodrome +1), each building in district provide +1 extra Exp; Units with higher level gain less Exp from districts.</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>同名Mod的优化版本，相应区域只会为匹配的单位提供经验值（如港口匹配海军单位）；区域本身提供+2经验值（航空港为+1），区域内的每一级建筑额外提供+1经验值；等级较高的单位从对应区域获取经验值的效率降低。</zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
	<Text id="OftenOviour_MOD_UGEFD_TEAS">
		<en_US> </en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN> </zh_Hans_CN>
	</Text>
  </LocalizedText>
</Mod>